flowchart TD
    subgraph Sources [Internal Data Sources]
        Docs[Policy Docs & Reports]
        Comms[Meeting Minutes & Emails]
        Wikis[Internal Wikis]
    end

    subgraph Pipeline [AI Knowledge Graph Pipeline]
        Ingest[Ingestion & Preprocessing]
        AIExtract[AI Entity & Relation Extractor]
        GraphDB[(Knowledge Graph Database)]
    end

    subgraph UI [Access Interfaces]
        SearchUI[Search & Graph Visualization UI]
        GovPortal[Governance & Security Control]
    end

    subgraph Users [Consumers & Governance]
        Staff[Departmental Staff & Researchers]
        Leader[Leadership Team]
        ITGov[IT & Data Governance]
    end

    Docs -->|Unstructured text| Ingest
    Comms -->|Unstructured text| Ingest
    Wikis -->|Unstructured text| Ingest

    Ingest -->|Cleaned text chunks| AIExtract
    AIExtract -->|Extracted nodes & edges| GraphDB

    Staff -->|Search query / Entity lookup| SearchUI
    SearchUI -->|Graph query| GraphDB
    GraphDB -->|Connected entities & context| SearchUI
    SearchUI -->|Visualized relationships| Staff

    Leader -->|Strategic insight request| SearchUI
    SearchUI -->|Org-wide relationship maps| Leader

    ITGov -->|Access policies & sensitivity rules| GovPortal
    GovPortal -->|Enforce security constraints| GraphDB